## Tools and APIs

1. Google Cloud Speech-to-Text API
   - Link: https://cloud.google.com/speech-to-text
   - Relevance: Powerful speech recognition service

2. Amazon Polly
   - Link: https://aws.amazon.com/polly/
   - Relevance: Text-to-Speech service useful for pronunciation examples

3. TensorFlow.js
   - Link: https://www.tensorflow.org/js
   - Relevance: Machine learning in JavaScript, useful for client-side processing

4. Web Speech API
   - Link: https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Web_Speech_API
   - Relevance: Browser-based speech recognition and synthesis

These resources cover various aspects of your project, from speech recognition and NLP to building real-time applications with React. While no single resource may cover your entire project scope, combining insights from these materials should provide a solid foundation for your development process.
